    <sys:String x:Key="Calib.Intro">Once calibration starts, the light strip switches to Tracking mode at 100% brightness. Use "Shift left/right" to shift the strip colors so that each LED matches the quadrant it sits in and aligns with the screen's four-color boundary. The diagram below shows the strip's start position and mounting direction, plus the color the current LED should show. If the mounting direction does not match, change the start direction in Tracking settings.</sys:String>
